/-! ## `P₁`: the five-vertex coefficients are local pair counts -/

/-- The rooting-averaged pair count of a listed K4-free five-vertex
representative is its local `1`-intersecting pair count over `30`: one
rational check per class. -/
lemma gamma5C_check :
    (((sym3Reps 5).filter fun H => decide (TetraFree.Mem H.toModel)).all
      fun H => decide (gamma5C H
        = (H.pairCountInter 1 : ℚ) / 30)) = true := by
